<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-29T17:01:06.689Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:01:06 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF drone strikes have hit Darfur markets, killing more than 100 civilians and have also struck a power station, cutting electricity to two states. The Sudanese army is accused of launching 162 drone attacks from Ethiopian territory, while Ethiopia denies involvement. Women are increasingly serving as frontline responders as the siege worsens and civilian arrests rise. Nearly 120,000 people have been displaced in Blue Nile state since January, according to a UN agency. The conflict caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168663&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNb0x6d2NxdVBNUVZZSG1LQWRPS3NidTYtRHpvLUloclpZSlFfdDktUTA1cWJkM2V2U2haVjBKOUhSQURucXlVQkdjWGZnREZwZzhMdEJwMmQ1WkNoY2NHcDJQUDJwVll4TDBLYjRlX2tTREpCTmk0cnR3bWdadkp5TFFMYWhCOXJrVjg4RHBXckVzWDVDQVYwSHVkM29tcFZGenMzUTA3T2k4cHVJLTYxSl9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPWkJTOVR2MzAyWEJiZG9IUzdraU9WU3VoVG1NUVlLdFFLblR2Q21HTEdPZGJvSFdCZk1vZllNOEk5Tmd2ZlNEMDlGbEdQU3pZa2wxVEJ4Rk9DRnowYkE4UENuZ2tPbHJjalZEZXhKQ3pmOGhxUWdGbzdpMWppXzJvaGx5TkIyQTAtWFZZb3cxNVh2UWNmLVRJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFA4Ml8zTWxDb3BONnN4dVZfZEkzWkx3cGpLMEpSRXZ5V3ZQSmFHYk8tazNKNjJIRFVRZl8xRGNmZG95NmVZTXMwRTJ5NWhyWExDVlBBLXBWbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE5TSFZyb0JfLWc4V2ZlZjdQZXQyTU5SbkljakNNV0lIQ1NVejJiWVpmdm1NVnZTUnJMczlxcVp6cDIzMEVXRmoyQ05VZHNSSUZlRDJzc2ZyTHNzYzBHMEVTNlhCT2ZTX0wxMmRPQWR3U0xodVBuVC15NA?oc=5&quot;&gt;EU Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Oman Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&qu